<title>USA: TABLE-Home Shopping Q2 shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Home Shopping Q2 shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PETERSBURG, Fla. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Home Shopping Network Inc</p>
<p>					    Three Months Ended June 30,</p>
<p>					     1997    1996(a)    1996(b)</p>
<p>Net Revenues</p>
