<p>		 (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>(a) Pro forma results stated as if the mergers with Home Shopping Network and Savoy occurred January 1, 1996 and exclude the operations of the Savoy motion picture business and include preliminary purchase accounting adjustments.</p>
<p>(b) Represents actual results of operations for Silver King Communications Inc only.</p>
<p>(c) HSN Inc owns 50 percent of the common equity and 100 percent  of the voting stock of SF Broadcasting.  As a result of voting and management control, its operating results are consolidated with HSN Inc's operating results.</p>
