<p>NOTE: The unaudited comparative pro forma financial information for Home Shopping Network Inc and subsidiaries is stated as if the merger with HSN occurred on January 1, 1996 and includes preliminary purchase accounting adjustments.</p>
<p>It also eliminates the broadcast carriage payments to Silver King but includes the corresponding operating costs of these stations.</p>
<p>The total adjustments to operating expenses for the three months and six months ended June 30, 1996 were $13.7 million and $27.5 million, respectively.</p>
